### Upper-Body / Lower-Body Split

Blend the torso and arms into a new animation while legs continue the old one.

```scheme
(define (walk-leg-angle t)
  (* 30.0 (sin (* 6.28 t))))

(define (wave-arm-angle t)
  (+ 90.0 (* 20.0 (sin (* 8.0 t)))))

(define (idle-arm-angle t)
  (* 5.0 (sin (* 3.0 t))))

(define (blend-x ax bx w)
  (+ (* ax (- 1.0 w))
     (* bx w)))

(motion
 (at 0.0
     (pose
      (entity 'figure
              (list
               (joint 'left-leg (walk-leg-angle 0.0) 0.0)
               (joint 'right-arm
                      (blend-x (idle-arm-angle 0.0)
                               (wave-arm-angle 0.0)
                               0.0)
                      0.0)))))
 (at 1.0
     (pose
      (entity 'figure
              (list
               (joint 'left-leg (walk-leg-angle 1.0) 0.0)
               (joint 'right-arm
                      (blend-x (idle-arm-angle 1.0)
                               (wave-arm-angle 1.0)
                               1.0)
                      0.0))))))
```

[VISUAL: Legs walk; right arm transitions from idle sway to wave.]

