### Blend Two Squash-Stretch Cycles

One cycle compresses vertically (heavy bounce), the other horizontally (elastic snap). Blend the scale axes independently.

```scheme
(define (heavy-scale-y t)
  (+ 1.0 (* -0.3 (abs (sin (* 4.0 t))))))

(define (elastic-scale-x t)
  (+ 1.0 (* 0.4 (sin (* 8.0 t)))))

(define (blend-x ax bx w)
  (+ (* ax (- 1.0 w))
     (* bx w)))

(motion
 (at 0.0
     (pose
      (entity 'blob
              (transform
               100.0
               100.0
               0.0
               (blend-x (heavy-scale-y 0.0) 1.0 0.0)
               (blend-x 1.0 (elastic-scale-x 0.0) 0.0)))))
 (at 1.0
     (pose
      (entity 'blob
              (transform
               100.0
               100.0
               0.0
               (blend-x (heavy-scale-y 1.0) 1.0 0.5)
               (blend-x 1.0 (elastic-scale-x 1.0) 0.5)))))
 (at 2.0
     (pose
      (entity 'blob
              (transform
               100.0
               100.0
               0.0
               (blend-x (heavy-scale-y 2.0) 1.0 1.0)
               (blend-x 1.0 (elastic-scale-x 2.0) 1.0))))))
```

[VISUAL: Blob shifts from vertical squash to horizontal wiggle as blend weight increases.]

