     (* bx w)))

(motion
 (at 0.0
     (pose
      (entity 'agent
              (transform
               (blend-x (agent-a-x 0.0) (agent-b-x 0.0) 0.3)
               100.0
               0.0))))
 (at 2.0
     (pose
      (entity 'agent
              (transform
               (blend-x (agent-a-x 2.0) (agent-b-x 2.0) 0.3)
               100.0
               0.0)))))
```

[VISUAL: Agent walks mostly straight with a subtle wave (30% of B's sine amplitude).]

