### Blend Two Particle-Swarm Velocities

Swarm A scatters radially. Swarm B converges to center. Blend the velocity fields.

```scheme
(define (scatter-vx x)
  (* 0.5 (- x 150.0)))

(define (converge-vx x)
  (* -0.3 (- x 150.0)))

(define (blend-x ax bx w)
  (+ (* ax (- 1.0 w))
     (* bx w)))

(define (particle-x x0 vx t)
  (+ x0 (* vx t)))

(motion
 (at 0.0
     (pose
      (entity 'particle-0
              (transform
               (particle-x 100.0
                           (blend-x (scatter-vx 100.0) (converge-vx 100.0) 0.6)
                           0.0)
               100.0
               0.0))))
 (at 2.0
     (pose
      (entity 'particle-0
              (transform
               (particle-x 100.0
                           (blend-x (scatter-vx 100.0) (converge-vx 100.0) 0.6)
                           2.0)
               100.0
               0.0)))))
```

[VISUAL: Particle initially left of center drifts slightly left (60% converge, 40% scatter).]

