### Blend Two Lip-Sync Visemes

Viseme \"O\" has mouth-open = 0.8. Viseme \"M\" has mouth-open = 0.1. Blend between them mid-word.

```scheme
(define (blend-x ax bx w)
  (+ (* ax (- 1.0 w))
     (* bx w)))

(motion
 (pose
  (entity 'mouth
          (list
           (joint 'jaw
                  (blend-x 0.0 -20.0 (blend-x 0.8 0.1 0.3))
                  0.0)))))
